#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_G8_Simulacrum_Base
#: liminal-union/units/golems/a0-g8-simulacrum.cfg:56
msgid "G8 Simulacra are Quickbound Golems wrought for training and proving. Their frames are brought to life by golem-script inscribed on parchment set within the construct. Corps artificers test the bound intellects awakened in each frame: only those of sufficient quality are elevated to full G9 Warform service — the rest serve out their purpose as Simulacra. Though not swift, the Simulacrum is sturdy and endures sustained engagement well. They serve as training partners and trial opponents for the corps. They wear down with use and must be regularly inspected and maintained by artificers."
msgstr "Los Simulacros G8 son Gólems de vínculo rápido creados para el entrenamiento y la prueba. Sus armazones cobran vida mediante escritura golémica en pergamino fijada en su interior. Las artífices del cuerpo evalúan los intelectos vinculados despertados en cada bastidor: solo los de calidad suficiente son elevados al servicio completo como Formas de guerra G9; el resto cumple su cometido como Simulacros."

