#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_G8_Simulacrum_1_1
#: liminal-union/units/golems/a0-g8-simulacrum.cfg:133
msgid "A G8 Simulacrum (1·1) – Core recalibration | Re-inscribed for drill and endurance trials, this training warform bears repeated strikes so that the corps may master formation and timing."
msgstr "Un Simulacro G8 (1·1) – Recalibración del núcleo | Reinscrito para instrucción y pruebas de resistencia, esta forma de entrenamiento soporta golpes repetidos para que el cuerpo domine la formación y el ritmo."

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_G8_Simulacrum_1_2
#: liminal-union/units/golems/a0-g8-simulacrum.cfg:142
msgid "🤖 🟕 G8 Simulacrum (1·2)"
msgstr "🤖 🟕 Simulacro G8 (1·2)"

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_G9_AI_Base
#: liminal-union/units/golems/b0-g9-ai.cfg:6
msgid "🤖 🟕 G9 AI"
msgstr "🤖 🟕 G9 AI"

#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_G9_AI_Base
#: liminal-union/units/golems/b0-g9-ai.cfg:57
msgid "G9 Warforms are Quickbound Golems bearing a bound intellect. Their frames are animated by golem-script set on small strips of parchment within the construct. Artificers of the corps carefully assess each awakened intellect: those of the highest order are elevated to the full Neural Curie Mainframe series. Though not swift, they are durable — able to hold a line, secure a retreat, or press through enemy ranks. They wear down with time and must be regularly maintained and inspected by skilled artificers."
msgstr "Las Formas de guerra G9 son Gólems de vínculo rápido dotados de un intelecto vinculado. Sus bastidores son animados por escritura golémica dispuesta en tiras de pergamino dentro del constructo. Las artífices del cuerpo evalúan cuidadosamente cada intelecto despertado: los de orden superior son elevados a la serie completa Neural Curie Mainframe. Aunque no son veloces, son resistentes: capaces de sostener una línea, cubrir una retirada o abrirse paso entre las filas enemigas."

