#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Hunterkiller_Base
#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/maiden/a2-hunterkiller.cfg:74
msgid "A Maiden Corps Hunterkiller belongs to the senior infantry reserve of the Maiden Corps. Almost all of them are mothers and grandmothers. They perfect their bowcraft at home — archery being more readily practiced without a partner than spear or blade — and in times of need may be called to serve, or step forward on their own to defend their communities. A Hunterkiller is a disciplined expert in ranged pursuit and encirclement. Those who take them for a minor nuisance seldom underestimate them a second time."
msgstr "Una Cazadora letal (Hunterkiller) pertenece a la reserva veterana de infantería del Cuerpo de Doncellas. Casi todas son madres y abuelas que perfeccionan su arquería en casa y acuden en defensa de sus comunidades cuando llega la necesidad. Es una experta disciplinada en persecución a distancia y cerco."

