#. [unit_type]: id=LIUN_Masterchief_Base
#: liminal-union/units/halfelven/marines/a2-masterchief.cfg:74
msgid "A Masterchief is a trained field commander serving in heavy active duty. He is the swiftest and most capable of the Marine Corps field officers — quick enough to press every advantage and steady enough to hold when others waver. Armed with leather armour, a hardened alu-bronze sword, and a precision sling, he is a proved keeper of the line, and a cornerstone of one of the most disciplined corps in the southern lands."
msgstr "Un Suboficial mayor (Masterchief) es un comandante de campo adiestrado en servicio activo pesado. Es el más veloz y capaz de los oficiales de campo del Cuerpo de Marines: lo bastante rápido para aprovechar cada ventaja y lo bastante firme para resistir cuando otros flaquean."

